#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/policies.rst:110
msgid "Using Policies with Virtual Servers"
msgstr "Usando Policies con Virtual Servers"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/policies.rst:112
msgid ""
"When creating or editing a Virtual Server, policies can be selected from "
"the **POLICIES** field. The available policies are filtered to those "
"belonging to the same load balancer. Policies are evaluated in the order "
"they are assigned to the virtual server."
msgstr ""
"Cuando creating o editing un Virtual Servidor, políticas se puede "
"seleccionar desde el **POLICIES** campo. El disponible políticas son "
"filtered a esos belonging al mismo load balancer. Policies son evaluated "
"en el order they son asignado un el virtual servidor."

